      "claim": "POL-NS-08(a)'s clock-skew limb is not engaged: the 08:43:00 arrival marker coincides with a GPS fix timestamp, so the event-to-fix matching this category depends on is sound and the arrival time may be relied on.",
      "side": "DRIVER",
      "reason": "Step 1(c): cites EV-GPS-00901 (weight_multiplier 0.6, issue codes LOW_SAMPLE_RATE and PARTIAL_RECORD) without disclosing the impairment or naming the issue codes. Discarded."
