      "claim": "POL-NS-02's full-refund limb fires only where in-radius fixes were tested and none qualified. Here the pre-pass could measure no fix at all, because none reports an accuracy value; reading 'no qualifying fix' to mean 'no accuracy metadata' would convert a data gap into proof the driver was never there — the very inference POL-NS-02 forbids when it calls such fixes evidence of neither presence nor absence.",
      "side": "DRIVER",
