      "claim": "The derived in-geofence dwell of 0 seconds (qualifying_fix_count 0) is an artifact of the accuracy filter rejecting every fix for want of a reported accuracy, not a finding that the driver left the pickup. POL-NS-06's shortfall arithmetic cannot be run on a trace in which no fix is measurable, so it cannot carry the rider's refund either. The trace is impaired (weight 0.6).",
