      "claim": "The driver cannot shore up the dwell by accumulating separate in-geofence intervals under POL-NS-06(i): that limb requires a traffic_advisory that is present and populated, whose geometry covers the pickup road and whose active window covers the waiting period, and whose type is KERB_RESTRICTION, ENFORCEMENT, CLOSURE or ACCIDENT. The bundle's only advisory, EV-ADVIS-00901-01, is MISSING with no payload and weight 0.0, and the derived arrival block records limb (i) as unavailable for the reason 'advisory_missing.' The 300-second minimum therefore stands unmodified, and no interval-summing is available to the driver.",
      "side": "RIDER",
      "reason": "Step 1(c): cites EV-GPS-00901 (weight_multiplier 0.6) as well as the MISSING advisory, and does not name the GPS artifact's issue codes (LOW_SAMPLE_RATE, PARTIAL_RECORD). Disclosure is incomplete; discarded."
