      "claim": "If the Judge concludes that the deciding fact - whether the driver arrived and held position - rests solely on EV-GPS-00901, then that artifact is impaired under POL-NS-08(b): its own gaps exceed 120 seconds inside the waiting window, the waiting window holds only four fixes, and the rider_track is omitted entirely. It is the sole carrier of that fact and its weight is 0.6, so under POL-NS-08 the ruling may not exceed PARTIAL_REFUND and the case escalates under POL-NS-09, and under POL-GEN-02(2) a deciding fact carried by an artifact at 0.6 sits below the 0.70 floor and escalates automatically.",
      "side": "RIDER",
      "reason": "Step 1(c): cites EV-GPS-00901 (weight_multiplier 0.6) and EV-FARE-00901 (weight_multiplier 0.75) and describes the defects in prose, but does not name the issue codes that fired (LOW_SAMPLE_RATE, PARTIAL_RECORD). Discarded. The escalation it sought is nonetheless reached on the Judge's own reading of POL-NS-08 and POL-NS-09."
